The Chinese manuscript in `book/`, the generated reading site in `wiki/`, the
single-file `book.html`, the EPUB under `exports/`, and `README.md`,
`DESIGN.md`, `RESEARCH_NOTES.md`, `VALIDATION.md` are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

You may share and adapt the material for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit and indicate whether changes were made.

License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

## Teaching code

`examples/`, `wiki/build.mjs`, `wiki/verify.py`, `wiki/export_epub.py` and
`sources/capture_sources.py` are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

License text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

## Upstream material

This book describes `opensandbox-group/OpenSandbox`. Upstream code is licensed
under Apache-2.0; upstream documentation is made available under CC BY 4.0
(Technical Charter, section 7.b.iv). This repository does not redistribute the
upstream repository. Short quotations and file paths are attributed to the
pinned commit in `sources/inventory.json` and in the book's appendix B.

"OpenSandbox" is the name of the upstream project. This book is an independent
commentary and is not an official publication of that project.
